.TH CBMAP_GET 3 "2026-07-10" "c_collections" "C Collections Library - Macros"
.SH NAME
cbmap_get \- get value by key (type-safe, returns value)
.SH LIBRARY
C Collections (libccollections, \-lccollections)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <cbstmap.h>

value = cbmap_get(hm_name, key);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
Type-safe wrapper for cbmap_get_elem_ref() that returns the actual value.
Calls fatal_err() if key not found or size mismatch.
.fi
.SH PARAMETERS
.nf
hm_name  BST map to search
key      Key to look up
.fi
.SH RETURN VALUE
.nf
Returns value associated with key
.fi
.SH NOTES
.nf
Returns value, not pointer
For strings, returns the char* itself
O(log n) search time
.fi
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR cbmap_get_ptr (3),
.BR cbmap_insert (3)
